  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ahip-demo-gender-identity</b></p><a name=\"ahip-demo-gender-identity\"> </a><a name=\"hcahip-demo-gender-identity\"> </a><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-gender-identity.html\"><code>http://hl7.org/fhir/gender-identity</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 4.0.1, the version found through the package references\"> version ?4.0.1</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-gender-identity.html#gender-identity-male\">male</a></td><td>Man</td><td>the patient identifies as male</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-gender-identity.html#gender-identity-female\">female</a></td><td>Woman</td><td>the patient identifies as female</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-gender-identity.html#gender-identity-transgender-man\">transgender-man</a></td><td>Transgender Man</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-gender-identity.html#gender-identity-transgender-woman\">transgender-woman</a></td><td>Transgender Woman</td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-gender-identity.html#gender-identity-non-binary\">non-binary</a></td><td>Non-Binary (neither exclusively male nor female)</td><td>the patient identifies with neither/both female and male</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/ahip-demo-additional-gender-codes</code><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>#GF</td><td>Gender Fluid (non-fixed gender indentity that may change overtime)</td></tr><tr><td>TS</td><td>Two Spirit (a person who has both a masculine and feminine spirit, traditionally used in Native American/Alaskan Native communities)</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <code>http://ahip.org/demographics/ImplementationGuide/ahip.demo/CodeSystem/AHIPDemoAdditionalNullFlavor</code><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated. No matching Code System found\"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td>PSIN</td><td>Please specify if not listed above</td></tr><tr><td>CNTR</td><td>I choose not to respond at this time</td></tr></table></li><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html\"><code>http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/v3-NullFlavor</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to 3.0.0, the version found through the package references\"> version ?3.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.2.0/CodeSystem-v3-NullFlavor.html#v3-NullFlavor-ASKU\">ASKU</a></td><td>I don't know</td><td>Information was sought but not found (e.g., patient was asked but didn't know)</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
  ] ;
